  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math> and <math><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math> is equal to:"
