  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0069_c85861aaf2d0.png\" /><br /><br />From the graph of <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></math> it is clear that <math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></math><br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0069_aafb88100a36.png\" /><br /><br />From the graph of <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br />It is clear that <math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br />Hence <math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></math></p>"
